Description: OpenVPN3 Linux CLI front-end with auto-reconnect
 Malvo is a command-line front-end for OpenVPN3 Linux. It starts VPN
 sessions and reconnects on disconnection without user intervention,
 and logs session status to the terminal. It uses an encrypted
 credentials file (path given as the only argument).
